        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghasmeahooda was gwadeagooda neajeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea gaba Abramu gweanyeew seedam ea damashageash ghwahidu NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Abramu, ak gwayeesha, “Aniini geewooschi ASEETA Hoauur; una asheedeawanean nea meeyeateeweey ghuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydasin neajeedeanyu aba dageascheedeanyu ea daang'u, ak gaydagoonyi jeata haw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoabeada Abramu ak gwatkuy ak gwayeesha ASEETA Abramu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ula, neajeedeanyu eagoonyeey ang'iing'i, gayhuuwa ghweanda eemoojiga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi maygudu eeguureewaneey gicha Abramu, gheawungaagu gajeeguura Abrahamu; aba gideaba naanung' huwa ghweanda eemoojiga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydagoonyi diibiga saang'a; ak gaydasin eemoojiga aba badaydaang'u, ak gaygwarina headaang'u sugoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydasin neajeedeanyu sea jeacheangaagu galanya aba seaygoojiga nyaawa aba neajeeda maygamuudean, ak gaydoaw ASEETA aba headaang'u ea aba jeacheangaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydagoonyi ang'iing'i, ea jeacheangaagu, ng'eanyiini ghamneawa uwoosi rabascheandean, ng'eanyiisean bea Ganaani, ak gaydoaw deang'wa damanda manda muudeanooda; ak gayghoah ASEETA nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha ASEETA Abrahamu, “Ak ang'iing'i, gajang'waanya neajeedeanyu, ang'iing'i sea jeacheangaagu aba jeeda seaygoojiga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih neajeedeanyu jea ang'waanya, mida dageascheedeanyu ea daang'u ea jiilnangaagu: Gilinyoo ea orjeeda gil mida jeedeang'wa gajeayaat ghasmeahooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gajeayaanyi ghasmeahooda ak geeyiilnyi ak gayghoah gwadeagooda neajeeda aba dageascheedeanyu ea daang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjeeda bea eawooji sis aba jeedeang'wa gajeayaat ghasmeahooda eeyiil; giliwas orjeeda aba jeeda seaygoojigaagu, iideepa eeji aba gheang'u, ghana ea soomjeanda sishaaha lapiya leabu darooraka, ak ea maba jeeda ghaheang'wa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea dea sijiilsa jeedeaba gheang'u ea dea ishaahi lapiyeadaang'u, gajaada ghasmeahooda eeyiil. Ak abeeda neajeedeanyu aba headaang'u ea maygwanda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida wassean miyeayaat ghasmeahooda eeyiil gajeeheeli buuneadaanyi; aba gideaba ninuus neajeedeanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha ASEETA Abrahamu, “Ghang'eada ghamneawa gatmoadaang'u was Sarayi mayguduguureewana gheawungaaschi Sarayi gaygureewana gheawungaaschi Sara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydaadaw niny ghawooda, ak gaydagoonyi orjeeda aba niny; ak gaydaadaw niny ghawooda, ak gayghoah gheamata eemoojiga; ak gaygwarina headaanyi sugoodiga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoabeada Abrahamu ak gwatkuy ak ghwaak reari, ak gwayi aba jeadaanyi, “Gaygwaji baleanda siida gweanyeeka apughala? Ak gaygwaji baleanda Sarayiheeda mideawa gweanyeew seedam ea damanamughuush?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Abrahamu ASEETA, “Anda minung' ghoah Shumwaheeli siida jea gwahearanan!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwayeesha ASEETA, “Manda, gaygwajiilneey Sarayiheeda was gatmoadaang'u baleanda, ak gayguureewana gheawungaaschi Isaka. Ak gaydasin neajeedeanyu sea niny was neajeeda maygamuudean aba jeacheangaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea naayiinyi gidirgu aba badayda Shumwaheeli; ng'ula, gaydaadaw ghawooda ak ghaanung' ghwasaang'ayiit jeacheangaaschi; ak gayghoah ghweanda sugoodi damaniyeenya, ak gaydanung' ghoah eemeeda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydasin neajeedeanyu sea Isaka, was dea jea gwajiilneey Sara gweanyiin damani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghoahiit baloolda sea niny, ghabeawa ASEETA heeda Abrahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaat Abrahamu orjeedaanyi was Shumwaheeli sea soomjooga sean sijiilsa jeedeaba gheanyi ghasmeahooda ghana gea shaaha lapiyeadaanyi, ak gooyiil giliwas ng'eedeeda aba jeedeaba gheanyi, gawuurji gidarukusiinda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Abrahamu gaba gweanyeew seedam ea damashageash damanda siyaada ghasmeahooda eeyiil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda Shumwaheleeda was orjeedaanyi gaba gweanyeew damasamwagu damanda siyaada ghasmeahooda ak geeyiil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahamu ea Shumwaheleeda was orjeedaanyi geeyeaduudayi ghasmeahooda ak geeyiil eaweecheanjagi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sea headiga sean mida jeedeaba gheanyi, was gea sijiilsa jeedeaba gheanyi ea fuga was soomjooga ak geeyiiluudayi sea niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
